      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 32,
      "zh": "在悬浮于深空的等距立方体平台上吞食发光晶体，蛇身会越来越长、速度越来越快。开局蛇会原地等待，按下方向键后才开始移动；按 Q / E 可旋转视角，切勿从平台边缘坠落。",
      "en": "Eat glowing crystals on an isometric cube platform floating in deep space; the snake grows longer and faster. It waits in place at the start and only moves after you press an arrow key; use Q / E to rotate the view, and never fall off the platform edge."
    },
